            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why choose the best salon interior designer for a refit?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">A refit is a chance to fix layout problems, not just repaint. A specialist spots what slows the team down and plans the new design around it.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Design That Brings Clients Back</h2>\n            <p>A salon lives on repeat visits. The best salon interior designer creates a place that feels special for clients and practical for staff, day after day.</p><p>Planning a salon in Hauz Khas or Green Park? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Talk to 9th Corner</a> about your space and budget.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}